{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0202_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0202_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "590a38a6a7e598feeb2790225a156c3503ba877331abcfeb2479ab6538a4b11f", "ja": "つ、つまりそれは、全てのアイドルちゃんが、\nありさのものということに……？　ふぉぉぉぉっ！", "zh": "也、也就是说，所有偶像都要成为亚利沙的东西……？呜哦哦哦哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
